Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要搬过去了  房租就给你缴了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'm gonna be moving out, so you are gonna be in charge of paying the rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对  什么时候要缴  每月1号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right, and when is that due? First of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是每个月吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's every month?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  你想住的月份才要缴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, just the months you actually want to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是电话费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here's the phone bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  要死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是电话号码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's our phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我突然决定要搬走的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I know I kind of sprung this whole me-moving-out-on-you thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我先帮你挡一阵子吧  不  不  不  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So why don't I just cover you for a while? No, no. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊崔比亚尼不接受施舍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey Tribbiani does not take charity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是施舍  乔伊  不行  别再说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not charity, Joe. No, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.13,0:00:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  但我不想再拿你的钱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I mean, thanks, but I'm done taking money from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以照顾自己  还有什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right? I can take care of myself. Now, what's next? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这是电费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, uh, here's the electric bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用个电要这么多钱  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is how much we pay for electric? Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他的帐单  待会儿再看了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we'll do the rest of the bills later, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第6集  最后一夜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E06  The One With Joey's Porsche
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.66,0:01:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那乔伊得搬出去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So is Joey gonna have to give up the apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望不用  我想给他钱  但是他不收\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope not. I tried to offer him money, but he wouldn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他需要多少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much do you think he needs?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想1千5应该够他活几个月了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figure $1500 would cover him for a few months, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我得骗他收下  免得伤到他的自尊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I have to trick him into taking it so I don't hurt his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不雇他当演员啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Well, why don't you hire him as an actor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以叫他装扮成演短剧   怎样都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could have him dress up and put on little skits whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样对自尊确实有帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that would help the pride thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是响当当啊  明天要不要搬来跟我住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you look great. Do you wanna move in with me tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay. okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们女生今晚要做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you girls have planned for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与其难过我和瑞秋要分开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Instead of being sad that tonight's my last night with Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不如我们出去吃饭庆祝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we thought we'd go out and celebrate:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋要搬去跟菲比住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel's moving in with Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的生日  今天不是你的生日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And also my birthday. Ha, ha.It's not your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.31,0:02:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样讲好恶劣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What a mean thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不会戳穿你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would never tell you it was not your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们男生有什么节目吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so you guys have anything planned for the big last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与其一起打混   我们决定什么也不做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, instead of just hanging out, we figure we'd do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是《尼克队》开慕战\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Knicks' season opener tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们想来我家看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought maybe you guys would come and watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怕你又吹嘘  说你放弃打球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not if you talk about how you gave up basketball...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去当古生物学家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to become a paleontologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就放弃了打球  去当古生物学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did give up a career in basketball to become a paleontologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我在想  你还没换衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, I was wondering. You're not dressed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们15分钟后就要去玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're supposed to start having fun in 15 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  早1分钟都不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, and clearly, not a minute sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你都打包好了吧  拜托  你说是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, you are packed, though, right? I mean, please tell me you're packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然打包好了  莫妮卡  别紧张啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course I'm packed. Monica, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想问问菲比  我该穿什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanted to ask Phoebe for her opinion on what I should wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我真是一刻也不得闲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, I cannot get a minute of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡会宰了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica's just gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你穿这样蛮适合惨死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What you're wearing is fine for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not packed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not packed even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你别发飚啊  是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Don't get mad, because, look, this is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始打包  然后想到  "我在干嘛"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I started packing, and then I realized, "What am I doing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最不会打包了  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am lousy at packing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你最爱打包了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you love packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以做为我的临别赠礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So as a gift to you on our last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以当总指挥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be coordinator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  对不起  我没帮你准备礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, I'm so sorry. I didn't get you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都要帮忙  菲比  你可以帮忙吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, everybody has to help. Phoebe, you can help, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是跟我们有约  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have plans with us. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德可以贴纸箱  罗斯封箱  乔伊搬东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Chandler can make boxes, Ross can wrap, and Joey can lift things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  去通知男生帮忙  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell the guys they have to help out. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. My God, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快逃   摩妮卡要叫你们收东西   她把工作都分好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hurry! Monica's gonna make you pack. She's got jobs for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是躲不掉了  你们快逃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, it's too late for me, but save yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那最好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搬家公司11个小时后会来   瑞秋还没打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The movers will be here in 11 hours. Rachel has not packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都得帮忙  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, everybody has to help. Chandler--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我和乔伊有事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I have plans with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说你们没事   这是最后一次了嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you said you were doing nothing. Yes, but for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine. Now, Ross--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法帮忙   为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, but I can't do it. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班要来   因为班要来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I’ve got Ben. Because, because I’ve got Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都快8点了  他都快上床了  他在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's almost 8:00, it's almost past his bedtime. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去参加晚宴了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's at a dinner party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.85,0:05:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真的要来吗   到时候我能看得到你家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is he really coming? Because I can see into your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course he is. Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道我会拿儿子当借口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think I'd just use my son as an excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我当成哪种爸爸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What kind of father do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得回家做个班的复制品了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta go make a fake Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了  室友时代最后的彼萨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here it is. Our last pizzas together as roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你会买披萨  我叫了中国菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish I'd known you were gonna do that. I ordered Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实这样蛮好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, actually, in a way it's kind of nice. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最后的两人晚餐  我  带我祖先的食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our last dinner together. Me, bringing the food of my ancestors...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  带你祖先的食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you, the food of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我有个比较奇怪的想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say, Joe, I had a strange idea for what to do on our last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来打几盘   赌钱如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you say we play a little, uh, foosball for money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了  自97年伤后复出  你就没赢过我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you crazy? You haven't beaten me once since my injury-plagued '97 season.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿钱送我还比较快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'd be easier if you'd just give me your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得50元如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. What do you say to $50?
