Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  那为什么你的东西都在这个箱子里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really? Well, how come all your stuff is in this box?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我知道是怎么回事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you guys, you guys, I think I know what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  停\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? You guys? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是假装生气   就怕相互舍不得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know that, I know that you're acting mad because you think that will make it easier to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实内心深处  你们还是很难过的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But deep down, you're still really sad. Deep, deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  菲比  我很生气   最最最深处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Phoebe, I am mad! Well, deep, deep, deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是很生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm just mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就继续追吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.11,0:13:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么牌  不重要  什么都比不上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you have? Doesn't matter. Nothing beats...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三和六\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a three and a six.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那叫D罩杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That, my friend, is "D Cup."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你目前为止  赢了多少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now, how much have you won so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:14:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  7百  不是正好7百吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Seven hundred. Not 700 exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  再加7百\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Heh. Double it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  在杯牌里   一旦赢到7百\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah, see, in Cups, once you get $700...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就得自动加码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you have to double it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  规则又不是我订的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Hey, I didn't make up the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到加码奖金后  你可以拿一张牌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so now, after you receive the doubling bonus, you get, uh, one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那张牌有可能值1百元  让你总共赢得1千5\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, that one card could be worth $100, which brings your total to 1500.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊  不  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别太兴奋   除非你拿到  不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't get too excited, because that's not gonna happen unless you get the-No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后一箱衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this is the last box of your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在上面注明  "你在想什么"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just gonna label it "What were you thinking?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思  我正想到对面  在钱德身上那样写\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Funny, I was just gonna go across the hall and write that on Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位  不是我想雪上加霜  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you guys, I don't mean to make things worse, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想跟瑞秋住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I don't wanna live with Rachel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你们对对方太刻薄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You're just so mean to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想跟瑞秋翻脸   我还是喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I don't wanna end up like that with Rachel. I still like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系   菲比  因为我不搬了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Phoebe, that's fine because I'm not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你一定要收留她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Phoebe, you gotta take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了很多她的坏话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I know I said some bad stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但瑞秋也有一些好室友的特质\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but Rachel does have some qualities that make her a good roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  像什么  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really? Like what, Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有几千双靴子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how she has 147,000 pair of boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个好的开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, good start, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.87,0:15:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会借给你穿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She lets you borrow them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你再用你的大脚把它撑大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you stretch them out with your big old clown feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想睡路边吗  天气要变冷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you wanna live outside? Because it's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有一大堆目录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She gets tons of catalogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会把我会喜欢的部分折起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, um, she'll fold down the pages of the things she thinks I'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What else? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我洗澡时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I take a shower...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会在镜子上留言给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she leaves me little notes on the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I do. I do do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  我喜欢浴室里有东西可读\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's nice. I like having things to read in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在沙发上看书看到睡着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I fall asleep on the couch after reading...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会帮我盖毯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she covers me over with a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你冷到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know, I don't want you to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我要跟钱德同居时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when I told her I was gonna be moving in with Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她非常支持我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she was really supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我无后顾之忧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You made it so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟一个男生住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have to live with a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我真希望你赶快搬进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Rachel. Now I can't wait to live with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们应该\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把摩妮卡也一起带来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bring Monica, and then we can all live there together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll have so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她要跟钱德住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, honey, I think she's moving in with Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是要跟他住吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're still set on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗  嘿  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Hey, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打包顺利吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How's the packing going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班  他很好  他就在  妈呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben? He's fine. Yeah, he's right-Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把头从衣服里伸出来  儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get your head out of your shirt there, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  是南瓜  我过去帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's a pumpkin. I'll come pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  罗斯和我帮忙打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong? Ross and I were helping the girls pack...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休息时  我跟他玩杯牌输了1千5\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...took a little break. I lost $1500 to him in Cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩杯牌  怎么会输那么多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wha--? How did you lose at Cups?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你输的方式一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The same way you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先拿到老K和皮蛋  砰  罗斯拿到2和3\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I started outwith the king and the queen. Barn. Ross gets a two and a three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我拿到杰克和老K  砰  罗斯拿到4和5\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I get a jack and a king. Boom. Ross gets a four and five.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯拿到满杯   D罩杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Even Ross was getting the Cup card, the D Cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和自动加码   我连半副杯牌都凑不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the sitting-down bonus. Meanwhile, I didn't even get a half cup. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他之前也没玩过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He never played before either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得玩杯牌都靠新手的牌运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I think? I think beginner's luck, very important in Cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们再玩一把\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's just play one more hand. One more hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  我1毛钱也输不起了  我是说真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no more. I cannot lose another dime. I'm serious this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我要送你一样东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, look. There's-I wanna give you something, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在先送  免得我因为赌债拿去当给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And let me give it to you now before I pawn it for Cups money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把大白狗送给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I want you to have the big, white dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你这些年来的照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as a-Kind of a thank-you for being such a great roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能收  你很喜欢这个雕像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't take the big, white dog. You love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是雕像   他是活的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's "him." Not "it."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我跟你买呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what if I bought it from you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以以合理的价格卖给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then your nice gesture would be giving it to me at a reasonable price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1千5如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say $1500?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  我知道你想干嘛了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a second. I see what you're trying to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又想塞钱给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're trying to give me money again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候塞钱给你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When did I try to give you money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前看帐单的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before, over there with the bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想施舍我  我说不要  你也就算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You tried to give me charity, I said no, you dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后  我们开心地度过最后一晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, then we had a nice last night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说笑  赌钱  谁也没塞钱给谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had some fun, we gambled, nobody tried to give anybody any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你  突然又想来这套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, out of the blue, you start with the charity thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想帮助你   我想确定你的生活没有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just trying to help you out, okay? I wanna make sure that you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会没问题的  听着  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will be okay. Look, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能老觉得我无法照顾自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta get it out of your head that I can't take care of myself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会怀念你借钱给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm not gonna miss you helping me outwith money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一会怀念的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only thing I'm gonna miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还有这只狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了后打电话给我  好吗  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call me when you get there, okay? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的会很想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙要还你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I have your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   多好笑  再过几小时就会见面了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, this is silly. I'm gonna see you in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye,house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Bye-bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真的走了  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She really left. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  不客气  室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. No problem, roomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以问你个问题吗  当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I ask you a question? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.97,0:21:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只狗怎么会在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell is that dog doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我捏造了杯牌   这样好塞钱给乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I invented the game of Cups as a way to give Joey money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你想把钱要回去  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now you want that money back? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你以为我是白痴吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, what kind of idiot do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有那种牌  那是我捏造的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a real game. I made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾  你输了钱  但我赢得光明正大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry you lost your money. But I won it fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游戏是假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At a fake game!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.87,0:21:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想赢一点回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, if you wanna try to make some of it back...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意陪着你玩  但我必须警告你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'd be glad to play you for it. But I should warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杯牌高手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am very good at Cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你上次玩  有出现杯盘牌吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now, I assume the saucer card came up when you played last?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这次会不会出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's see if it comes up this time.
